{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-02_end",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-02",
  "title": "雨の中を歩く",
  "storyCode": "4-2",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5ebe7c8910cfb51da3ea530a289b11e76e03a86f5c28d6604de70022275f8775",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あっ！　そ、そこどいてっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "きゃっ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ご、ごめんなさい！　ぶつかるつもりじゃなかったんだけど……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ううん、大丈夫。そうしてすぐに謝れるなんて、立派だね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "わわ、そうかな？　えへへ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ところで、お姉さんはここで何してるの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "この辺は雨が降ってるし、雨宿りしたほうがいいんじゃない……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ええっと……ううん、その……少しお散歩してただけだから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "それより君、何か手伝ってほしいことがあるんじゃない？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "えっ！　どうしてわかったの！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ふふっ、ないしょ。これはお姉さんの秘密だからね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ええ～？　……んー、まあいっか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "じゃあさ、お願いがあるんだけど――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うーん……でも、やっぱり無理かなあ……お姉さん、背が小さいし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "もう、そんなこと言っちゃダメだよ！　君に比べたら、私のほうが背が高いでしょ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "わわ、ごめんって！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "それじゃ……とりあえず、やってみる？　えっとね、この板どかすのを手伝ってほしいんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下敷きになってる蓄音機を持って帰りたくてさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "これ？　うん、やってみよっか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "じゃあいくよ。いち……にの……さん！　えいっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "！　できた！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……っ、これは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "わあっ、お姉さん力持ちだね！　ありがとう！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "うん、でも……この蓄音機、壊れてるみたいだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大丈夫大丈夫！　見つけた時にはもう壊れてたしね。いつか、これをちゃんと直して使えるようにするつもりなんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "実は僕、みんなのためにレコードをいっぱい集めててさ。まあ、自分でも、一度も聴いたことないんだけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "でも、いつかみんなに聴かせてあげようと思って！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……難しい目標のはずなのに、簡単なことみたいに口に出せるなんて……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……私、何のために行動してるのかな。……私にできることって、何だろう……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……あのさ、お姉さんは僕のこと、怖くないの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ううん。……どうして、怖がられると思ったの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "だって僕、鉱石病なんだよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あははっ、私もそうだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "え～っ！　こんなに可愛いのに感染者なんて、もったいない……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "感染者になったからって、全部台無しになるわけじゃないんだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "だって、たとえ君が感染者でも、そうじゃなくても――いい子でいたなら、その事実までは変わらないでしょう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ん～……そうなの？　よくわかんないや……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（ぐう……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……もしかして、お腹ぺこぺこ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……うん……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……じゃあ、これあげる。って言っても、これしかないんだけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "えっ、いいの？　やった、ありがとう！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……あれ？　そういえば……お姉さんって、なんでここに来たの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "それは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……私が……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ある人と、約束したからなんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――お姉さん、またね！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "うん、またね！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あの子みたいな子供でも、結局、最後には……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "感染者め。お前たちはもう、人ではない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "私にできることを、もっと……もっと考えないと……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……どうして……全員を守ることは、できないんだろう……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "お前にできるはずがない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そんな……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "飢餓、迫害、そしていずれ訪れる凄惨な死……\n感染者の末路など、ほかにはない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そんなこと、ない……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ロドスが、感染者のために立ち続ける限り……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "お前は数少ない恵まれた人間の一人だ。そんなことを言えるのは、そのためでしかない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "違う……！　多くの人が団結して、同じ目標に向かって努力し続けているからこそ、私は……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "この大地は、すでに麻痺してしまったんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……いいえ、まだそうはなってない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "感染者を、絶望の淵に追いやらせはしない……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "アーミヤ。\n怒りに身を任せるが良い。\nただのそれだけで――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……ダメ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "絶対に……そんなこと、しない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "だって、私は……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あの人と、約束したんだから――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "この声は……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あのお姉ちゃんが教えてくれたんだ。このお人形は、誰かのために作るから意味があるんだよ、って！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "だからね、これ、龍のお姉ちゃんのために作ったの！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性の声",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "今聞こえたのって、もしかして……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "やっぱり、あの後ろ姿は――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "チェンさん？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": null,
